# Pet list after a game update

When an Old School RuneScape update has shipped since the review date below, compare it with `UniqueItems` before finishing other plugin work.

Read the update post, the All Pets collection log, and the Metamorphosis page.

Add a missing collection-log pet, including an inventory name used by a metamorph. Add an item that exists to metamorphose a pet. Leave logs, ores, berries, seeds, firelighters, mole claw, mole skin, and spirit flakes off the morph list unless the user asks for one of them.

Match the inventory name, ignoring letter case. Names that start with "Pet ", end with " (pet)", or are a listed name followed by " (variant)" are already covered.

Update the test, README, and the review date below in the same change.

Last reviewed: 3 November 2026, Quest Month Kick Off, TFA Tweaks & More. No new pet or morph item.
